      "content": "it's not even that i'm overwhelmed, it's just that there's nothing left to reconnect to. the things i used to love... the way people used to talk, the way life felt slower... it's all gone. i feel like a relic. like a piece of old technology that nobody has the parts for anymore. just sitting there, useless, waiting for the battery to finally die.",
